01:17:15.023 --> 01:17:16.092
E poi...

01:17:16.703 --> 01:17:18.223
e poi...

01:17:18.223 --> 01:17:20.339
il tunnel si spaccava in due.

01:17:37.223 --> 01:17:38.975
